    (37, N'CAHOOTS - Eugene only', N'Provides on site care for mental health or substance abuse emergencies, conflict resolution/mediation, transport for services to specific facilities, deals with housing crises and first aid. Dispatched by police non-emergency line, operated by White Bird Clinic.', N'https://whitebirdclinic.org/cahoots/', N'', N'All hours, every day', 1, NULL, N'System Data Load', '2023-06-29T21:23:01.470000', N'Lynnb', '2024-09-21T20:43:25.232708'),
