    (180, N'Meals on Wheels ', N'Meals on Wheels is available throughout Lane County and is provided by one of two organizations, depending on geographic location. LCOG Senior & Disability Services (Senior Meals Program) delivers in Cottage Grove, Creswell, Florence, Junction City, Oakridge, Springfield, and Veneta. FOOD for Lane County delivers in Eugene.This service is available to people who are age 60 and over who are homebound and who are unable to shop for or safely prepare meals on their own.The spouse or disabled dependent child of any age who resides with an older adult who is eligible under this criteria, if it is in the best interest of the homebound consumer. Persons under age 60 may be eligible if their Case Manager has authorized meals as part of their Medicaid Long-Term Care Service Plan or State Planned Personal Care.To request Meals on Wheels Service call the provided numbers.  ', N'https://laneseniormeals.org/', N'', N'Monday, Wednesday, Friday 11 a.m. to 1 p.m.', 1, NULL, N'System Data Load', '2023-06-29T21:23:01.470000', N'host', '2025-07-30T01:26:40.308030'),
    (185, N'Mid Lane Cares', N'Serves the 475 square mile area known as Fern Ridge with various programs, including: Love Project Food Pantry, Free Medical Clinic, Senior Meals & Programs, Emergency Assistance, Jim Petty Scholarship Fund, S.A.N.T.A, and Silver Tree.', N'https://midlanecares.com/', N'', N'Call for specific program hours.', 1, NULL, N'System Data Load', '2023-06-29T21:23:01.470000', N'host', '2025-03-15T19:53:31.773691'),
