    (268, N'Share Fair', N'A really free market and fun social event with free food, clothes, supplies, massages, haircuts, music, and more! Check solidaritysharefair.org for info on the next event.', N'https://neighborhoodanarchists.org/sharefair/', N'sharefair@neighborhoodanarchists.org', N'Check website for event schedule', 1, N'{"Name": {"Value": {"en": "Share Fair"}}, "Description": {"Value": {"en": "Every month Share Fair gives away care packages and food at five locations. The service is mobile. The locations includes Washington/Jefferson Park, Whittaker, Downtown Eugene, West Eugene and Springfield. If you need a care package, please check out the website or contact us through email, sharefair@neighborhoodanarchists.org", "es": "Cada mes, Share Fair regala paquetes de ayuda y alimentos en cinco ubicaciones. El servicio es móvil. Las ubicaciones incluyen Washington / Jefferson Park, Whittaker, Downtown Eugene, West Eugene y Springfield. Si necesita un paquete de atención, visite el sitio web o contáctenos por correo electrónico, sharefair@neighborhoodanarchists.org"}}, "HoursOfOperation": {"Value": {"en": "Last Tuesday of every month, 3 to 6:30 p.m.", "es": "Último martes de cada mes, de 3 a 6:30 p.m."}}}', N'System Data Load', '2023-06-29T21:23:01.470000', N'host', '2025-03-29T00:45:45.389269'),
