    (275, N'SOAP', N'Harm reduction supplies and case management for youth (16-29) who live on the street in the Eugene/Springfield/Cottage Grove area. Naloxone Distribution/Overdose Education; Safe Sex Items; Syringe Services; Harm Reduction Supplies; Wound Care Services. Call or email to schedule a time to meet.541core@gmail.com.', N'https://coreeugene.org/', N'availableInfo@coreeugene.org', N'All days, all hours', 1, N'{"Name": {"Value": {"en": "SOAP"}}, "Description": {"Value": {"en": "Harm reduction supplies and case management for youth (16-29) who live on the street in the Eugene/Springfield/Cottage Grove area. Naloxone Distribution/Overdose Education; Safe Sex Items; Syringe Services; Harm Reduction Supplies; Wound Care Services. Call or email to schedule a time to meet.541core@gmail.com.", "es": "Suministros para la reducción de daños y manejo de casos para jóvenes (16-29) que viven en la calle en el área de Eugene/Springfield/Cottage Grove. Educación sobre distribución / sobredosis de naloxona; Artículos de sexo seguro; Servicios de jeringas; Servicios de cuidado de heridas. Llame o envíe un correo electrónico para programar una hora para reunirse: meet.541core@gmail.com"}}, "HoursOfOperation": {"Value": {"en": "All days, all hours", "es": "Todas las día, todas las horas"}}}', N'System Data Load', '2023-06-29T21:23:01.470000', N'host', '2025-03-29T02:18:27.506437'),
